Package: screensight
Version: @VERSION@
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Rémy Sanchez <remy.sanchez@hyperthese.net>
Depends: cage, avahi-daemon, libc6, libxkbcommon0, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libxcb1, libfreetype6, libwayland-client0, libwayland-cursor0, libwayland-egl1, libvulkan1, libgcc-s1
Description: Screensight display daemon for Home Assistant
 A full-screen Home Assistant companion display daemon for the Raspberry Pi.
 It advertises itself over mDNS, supports device-verified pairing with one or
 more Home Assistant instances, keeps a heartbeat WebSocket link, and renders a
 configurable display text on the 800x480 touch panel.
